rmation such as social security/national ID number, passport information, or banking information.",my_resume_info_two:"The following formats are accepted: pdf, doc, docx, rtf, odt, txt file (5MB or smaller in size)."},resume_upload:{icon:" %{image} icon ",local_upload:" on your machine to upload resume ",replace_resume:" replace resume ",resume_options:" replace resume options ",to_upload_resume:" to upload resume ",upload_resume_from:"upload a resume from %{resume_source} %{subtitle}",your_device:"upload a resume from your device %{subtitle}"},retry:"Try again",sensitive_data:"%{file_name} contains confidential data",subtitle:"Please use a .pdf, .doc, .docx, .rtf, .odt, or .txt file smaller than 5MB",title:"Upload your resume",upload_drop_box:"DropBox",upload_google:"Google Drive",upload_incomplete_modal:{modal_body:"It looks like you\u2019re in the middle of uploading your resume. If you leave before the upload is complete, your changes will be lost. Are you sure you want to leave the application page?",modal_primary_label:"Yes, leave this page",modal_secondary_label:"No, stay on this page",modal_title:"Resume upload in progress"},upload_linkedin:"LinkedIn",upload_one_drive:"OneDrive",upload_success_toast:"Your resume was uploaded successfully.",virus_scan:{failed_to_scan:{subtitle:"Please try again later.",title:"We're sorry. We're unable to upload your resume at this time"},threat_detected:{subtitle:"Please upload a different file.",title:"%{file_name} could not be uploaded to the system because a virus was detected"}}},edit:"Edit",errors:{file_upload:{authorization_failed:"Cloud provider authorization failed",authorization_failed_action:"An error occurred completing the sign-in process, please try again.",cloud_provider:"This resume can\u2019t be uploaded from %{cloud_provider}. Please upload another resume.",empty_file:"Sorry, that file is empty",file_selection_failed:"An error occurred selecting your chosen file",file_selection_failed_action:"Please report this issue",file_size:"Sorry, that file is too big",file_type:"Sorry, we don't support that file type",generic:"We're sorry. We\u2019re unable to upload your resume at this time. Please try again later.",mime_type:"Sorry, we don't support that content type",retry:"Your original resume still exists, do you want to try again?",subtitle:"Please upload a .pdf, .doc, .docx, .rtf, .odt, or .txt file"},s3:"AWS S3 error: %{error}",secondary_email_required_message:"A personal email address is required for receiving updates on your applications.",validation:{isAcknowledged:"You must acknowledge that you have read and understand the terms above before you can submit your application. Please check the box if you agree.",isDateInRange:"Please enter a valid date or month",isDateRangeValid:"Invalid date range",isRequired:"This field is required",isTextValidLength:"Text length should be between %{min} and %{max}",isUnderMaxLength:"Text is too long",isValidAddress:"'%{field}' can only contain letters, numbers and the following special characters -',.;# +/()'\"`!&",isValidDate:"Please enter the date in the format %{format}",isValidDateRangeEndDate:"Please enter the end date in the format %{format}",isValidDateRangeStartDate:"Please enter the start date in the format %{format}",isValidEmailAddress:"Invalid email address",isValidMonth:"Please enter the month in the format %{format}",isValidName:"'%{name}' cannot contain special characters. '%{name}' can only contain letters, numbers, hyphens (-), periods (.) and apostrophes (')",isValidNumber:"Invalid number",isValidPhoneNumber:"Invalid phone number",isValidPostalCodeFormat:"Please enter a valid postal code for the selected country."}},form:{answer_label:"Answer",answer_prefix:"A. ",disabled:"disabled",from_to:"From %{from} to %{to}",not_available:"N/A",not_saved:"Not saved",ongoing:"ongoing",optional:"(optional)",question_label:"Question",question_prefix:"Q. ",required:" required ",summary:"Summary"},get_started_with_questionnaire:"Start questionnaire",hide_answers:"Hide answers",hide_answers_form:"Hide answers for %{form} form",id_verification:{begin_verification:"Begin identity verification",completed_text:"Identity verification upload completed",consent_checkbox_error:"Uploading a picture of your government ID and a selfie is required to complete your application.",consent_checkbox_title:"I consent to identity verification",contact_info_verified_banner:"Your identity has been verified. Any change to your legal name will require re-verification.",continue_button:"Continue",failed_text:"Identity verification was not completed. Please try again.",header:"Identity verification",name_change_banner:"Because you changed your legal name, you are required to re-verify your identity.",name_change_undo:"Undo",name_confirmation:{cancel:"Cancel",continue:"Continue to ID verification",description:"It should match the name on your government ID.",header:"Is this your legal name?",info_text:"After you complete the identity verification, you'll come back to your application.",legal_first_name:"Legal first name",legal_last_name:"Legal last name",warning:"After identity verification, you won't be able to update your legal name. Please check that it's correct before continuing."},not_ready_header:"Don\u2019t have your ID photo ready?",not_ready_text:"No worries - your progress is saved and you can upload it later. However, your application won\u2019t be considered until you complete the identity verification, review, and submit your application. You\u2019ll get an email reminder from Amazon to complete your application.",privacy_link_text:"Privacy notice and data usage",reverification_banner:"Because you changed your legal name, you are required to re-verify your identity.",verification_info_one:"To verify your identity, please upload a picture of your government ID and take a photo of yourself in the verification portal. Verifying your information helps us to protect your identity. You will need a working camera on the device to take the photo in the frame.",verification_info_two:"Make sure your ID photo is clear, with all corners visible and no glare or blur. Accepted formats: jpg, png (10MB max)"},job_title_id_link:"%{title} (ID:%{id_icims})",my_applicantion_progress:"My progress",next_step:"Next",review_application:"Review application and forms",review_application_subtitle:"Please review each section of the application and its accompanying forms to ensure that the information is correct. Once you're ready, click Submit to finalize this portion of the application process.",save_and_continue:"Save & continue",secondary_email_message:"If you\u2019d like to receive automated email notifications, please add a secondary email address to your profile. If you don\u2019t wish to receive automated notifications, you can leave this field blank.",show_all_answers:"Show all answers",show_all_answers_form:"Show all answers for %{form} form",skip_and_continue:"Skip & continue",skip_form_warning_modal:{modal_body:"It looks like you're in the middle of filling out this section. If you choose to skip ahead, any unsaved changes will be discarded. <strong>Are you sure you want to skip and continue?</strong>",modal_primary_label:"Yes, skip section",modal_secondary_label:"No, stay on this page",modal_title:"Unsaved changes"},sms_notifications:{body:"To receive SMS updates, please verify your mobile number so we know you own that number and we're sending updates to the right person. Your applications will be processed normally even if you don't verify your number.",body_note:"<strong>Note:</strong> Skip this step if you don't want SMS updates or don't have a mobile number.",header:"Get SMS updates on your job applications",navigation_title:"SMS Notifications",sub_header:"Enable SMS updates (with a simple verification process)"}},application:{status:{assessment:"Pending assessment",assessment_expired:"Assessment expired",assessment_pending:"Pending Assessment",draft:"Draft",hire_confirmed:"Hired",inactive:"Inactive",no_longer_under_consideration:"No longer under consideration",submitted:"Application submitted",under_consideration:"Under consideration",withdrawn:"Withdrawn"}},application_questions:{centralized_hiring:{bubble_picker_dropdown:"Select a domain"},date_field:{date_label:"Date: Year-Month-Day"},date_range:{current_value:"Present",date_placeholder:"YYYY-MM-DD",date_placeholder_read:"YYYY dash MM dash DD",date_placeholder_without_days:"YYYY-MM",date_placeholder_without_days_read:"YYYY dash MM",end_date_label:"End Date: Year-Month-Day",ongoing:"Check if ongoing",start_date_label:"Start Date: Year-Month-Day"},"default-dropdown-option":"Select an option",errors:{applicant_not_found:"Sorry! Something went wrong. Please return to the applications dashboard.",generic:"Please submit a ticket by clicking the button below. We will resolve the issue as quickly as possible.",invalid_input:"Some of the answers are invalid. Please validate the form again.",job_not_found:"Oops! This job no longer exists!",required_question_not_answered:"A required question has not answered. Please answer all required questions",title:"Whoops, Something Went Wrong"},header:{work_history:"Tell us about your work history"},jobs:{id:"ID: %{job_id}",job_title:"%{job_title} (L%{job_level})",missing_value:"--"},multiselect_dropdown:{invalid_answer:"Response cannot contain special characters like '<', '>', '\\' or '/'",nested_includes_items:"%{title} (Includes %{children})",nested_includes_next_n_items:"%{title} (Includes the next %{number} items)",options_unavailable:"The location you previously selected is no longer available. Please select a new one.",remove:"Remove %{selected_value}"},"success-message":"Toast successfull",tooltip_modal:{learn_more:"Learn more"}},application_tab:{active_applications_header:"Active (%{number})",active_applications_mobile_header:"Active (%{number})",applications:{active_empty:"Sorry, we don't have any active applications for you. To find a job, search for jobs at the link below.",application_detail:{application_control_text:"We\u2019re not taking new applications for this job right now, but don\u2019t worry\u2014we still have yours. Use \u2018Role details\u2019 to view the job description.",application_date:"Applied: %{applied_date}",assessment_days_remaining:"Days remaining: %{assessment_days_remaining}",assessment_not_ready:"We're sorry. This assessment is temporarily unavailable. Please wait 5 minutes before refreshing the page to try again.",assessment_third_party:"This assessment is managed by a third-party assessments provider and will open in a new window.",complete_application_third_party:"This application is hosted by a third-party provider. You will be redirected to the third-party system to complete your application.",hiring_manager:"Hiring Manager",job_title_aria_label:"%{title} job ID %{id}",last_updated:"Last updated",location:{label:"Location"},no_location_aria_label:"No location specified",no_manager_aria_label:"No hiring manager specified",not_listed:"Not listed",resume_application:"Complete application",resume_application_aria_label:"Resume application for job with title %{title} and ID %{id}",status:{assessment:"Assessment",submitted:"Application submitted",under_review:"Application under review"},take_assessment:"Launch assessment",take_assessment_aria_label:"Launch assessment for job with title %{title} and ID %{id}",view_application:"View application",view_application_aria_label:"View application for job with title %{title} and ID %{id}",view_application_third_party:"This application is hosted by a third-party provider. You will be redirected to the third-party system to view your application.",withdraw_aria_label:"Withdraw from job with title %{title} and ID %{id}",withdraw_button:"Withdraw"},archived_empty:"Sorry, we don't have any archived applications for you.",search_jobs:"Search jobs"},applications_count:"Showing %{start} - %{end} of %{total} applications",applications_list:"applications list",archived_applications_header:"Archived (%{number})",archived_applications_mobile_header:"Archived (%{number})",aria_label:{active_applications:"active applications",active_applications_header:"%{number} of active applications ",archived_applications:"archived applications",archived_applications_header:"%{number} of archived applications",current_page:"current page",disabled:"disabled",job_withdraw_label:"withdraw %{job_title}",next_page_of_group:"next page of %{group}",overflow_menu:"%{job_title} popover.",page_no_of_group:"page %{no} of %{group}",previous_page_of_group:"previous page of %{group}"},candidate_consent_banner:{body_text:"Go to Settings to provide your consent for Amazon and its affiliated entities to retain and use your personal application data to consider and contact you for other Amazon job opportunities. You can revoke your consent at any time by changing your consent choice in Settings.",button_text:"Go to Settings",heading_text:"Would you like to be considered for other job opportunities?"},job_details:{aria_label:{associated_job_category:"Job category %{category}",associated_location:"Location %{location}",associated_team:"Team %{team}",role_details:"Role details for job with title %{title} and ID %{id}"},description:{basic:"Basic Qualifications",description:"Description",preferred:"Preferred Qualifications"},loading_header:"Please wait while we fetch role details...",meet_the_team:{hiring_manager:"Hiring Manager",recruiter:"Recruiter",title:"Meet the Team"},title:"Role details"},load_more:"Load more",loading_applications:{header:"Please wait while we fetch your applications..."},no_applications:{call_to_action:"Search for a job",header:"Sorry, we don't have any applications for you"},overflow_menu:{job_detail:"View job details",withdraw:"Withdraw"},sp_salesforce_banner:{body_text:"If you've started applications for SDE or technical graduate or internship roles in North America, and do not see them listed above, please check the Student Programs application portal.",call_to_action:"Visit the portal",heading_text:"Are some applications missing?"},withdraw_application_modal:{body_text:"By continuing, this will withdraw your application and notify the recruiting team that you are no longer interested in the %{job_title} (ID: %{job_id}) position.",cancel_text:"Cancel",header_text:"No longer interested in this position?",submit_text:"Withdraw application",submit_text_xs:"Withdraw",success_message:"Application Withdrawn"}},applying:{buttons:{submit:"Submit application"}},assessment:{acknowledgement:{intro:"By clicking the 'Take assessment' button I acknowledge that:",line_four_cf:"I have read and understand %{privacy_hyperlink}.",line_four_cs:"We know that you care how we use information about you and we appreciate your trust in us to do that carefully and sensibly. Please consult our %{privacy_hyperlink} to know more about how we collect, use and transfer the personal data of our candidates.",line_one:"Responses to all assessments in this application process are my own.",line_three:"I understand that I may be asked to justify my answers and that any misrepresentation will result in rejection of my application.",line_two:"I did not consult any other person or use any additional resources while completing the assessments.",privacy_hyperlink_cf:"Amazon's Candidate Assessment Online Privacy Notice",privacy_hyperlink_cs:"Privacy Notice",title:"Acknowledgement"},action_label:"Take assessment",auto_submitting_form:{content:"Please wait to be redirected...",timeout:"If you are not automatically redirected, please come back later or contact our support team."},contact_support:"Contact support",content:{intro:"You are about to complete an assessment that is part of the application process.",line_four:"If you are a person with a disability or are unable to complete the assessment and would like to request an accommodation for a modified version or other assistance, please %{support_hyperlink}.",line_one_v1:"Assessment should take approximately %{duration} minutes to complete.",line_one_v2:"Depending on the role and region where you are applying, assessment times will vary. Please plan for up to %{duration} minutes to complete the assessment.",line_three:"After you finish the assessment or if you have already taken this assessment, you will be returned to your application process.",line_two:"We recommend that you find a quiet place to avoid distractions.",support_hyperlink:"contact our candidate care team"},exit:{content:"Please come back and finish the assessment to complete your application. You can continue your assessment by navigating back to %{ats_link}. You may now close this window.",header:"Your assessment is not yet complete"},loading_assessment:"Loading assessment...",page_title:"Assessment",timeout:"We are experiencing some technical issues with the assessment. Please come back later or contact our support team.",wait:{content:"Sit tight! Your results are on the way...",processing_results:"Getting your results...",timeout:"It's taking longer than usual to get your results due to some technical issues. Please come back later or contact our support team.",warning:"We're still working on gathering your results, it's taking longer than usual to get your results."},welcome_applicant:"Welcome %{first_name} %{last_name},",welcome_back_applicant:"Welcome back, %{first_name} %{last_name}!"},assessment_privacy_notice:{content:{here:"here",intro:"We know that you care about how we use information about you and we appreciate your trust in us to do that carefully and sensibly. Please consult our %{privacy} or read below to know more about how we collect, use and transfer the personal data of our candidates.",item_eight:{line_one:"If you are in the EU, you have the right to request access to, correction, or deletion of your Application Data, to ask for data portability. You are also entitled to object to the processing of your Application Data in certain instances. If we process your Application Data based on your consent, you may withdraw it for the future at any time. To make a data subject request, please contact us on %{privacy_email}. Please contact us any time as outlined in \u201cQuestions and queries\u201d under the following link: %{privacy_eu}.",line_three:"Outside of the EU, please visit our %{privacy} on amazon.jobs for further information.",line_two:"You can also lodge a complaint with the responsible supervisory authority.",title:"8. Your rights"},item_five:{item_four:"protecting our rights and fulfilling our legal obligations.",item_one:"determining your qualifications for employment and reaching a recruitment decision;",item_three:"determining when you may take the Assessment again (after a Fail Result); and",item_two:"informing you, via email, about the progress of your application for employment with AMAZON and - potentially - scheduling an interview with you;",line_one:'Based on our legitimate interests to assess our Applicants (Article 6 (1) sentence 1 lit. f of the Regulation (EU) 2016/679 ("<b>GDPR</b>"), AMAZON processes Application Data for the following purposes:',line_two:"Should your application for employment be successful (Pass), your Application Data may be processed for the necessary employment purposes and included in your employment file.",title:"5. Purposes of Processing Application Data and Legal Basis"},item_four:{line_one:'We process your Application Data in order to evaluate your suitability for employment vacancies at the time when you take the Assessment. Depending on your Assessment results, an automated decision ("<b>Pass</b>"/"<b>Fail</b>") will be generated. Only in case of a Pass Result, you will move forward in the AMAZON application process. In case of a Fail Result, we will use your Application Data in order to verify that you do not take the Assessment again. If you are in the EU and in the case of a Fail Result, you have the right to express your point of view and contest the decision. In order to do so, please contact %{privacy_email}.',title:"4. How We Process Application Data"},item_nine:{line_one:"We may decide to change this Notice. If the change is fundamental or may significantly affect you, we will provide you with the updated Notice in advance of the change actually taking effect. We encourage you to review the content of this Notice regularly.",title:"9. Changes to this notice"},item_one:{line_one:'In this AMAZON Candidate Online Assessment Privacy Notice ("<b>Notice</b>") we describe how AMAZON and its affiliates as outlined below ("<b>AMAZON</b>" or "<b>we</b>") treat the personal data of applicants ("<b>Applicants</b>" or "<b>you</b>") who apply for employment with us by passing an AMAZON Online Assessment ("<b>Assessment</b>").',title:"1. Introduction and scope"},item_seven:{line_one:"We may store your Application Data in accordance with AMAZON Retention Policies for a period of four years after a decision was communicated to you. If your application for employment was successful, your Application Data may be processed for and included in your employment file.",title:"7. Retention Period"},item_six:{eu_data_protection_link_name:"official EU template",item_one:"With employees of AMAZON only on a need-to-know basis for the purposes as described in Chapter 5 above <b>who are either directly involved with the hiring decision.</b> Or, following completion of your candidate profile on amazon.jobs and completion of the Assessment, the information that you have uploaded will be made available to AMAZON's EU Recruitment Team (employees of Data Controller) and AMAZON's US Talent Assessment Team (employees of Amazon.com, Inc., P.O. Box 81226, Seattle, WA 98108-1226, USA). The Data Controller and Amazon.com, Inc. have concluded <b>Standard Contractual Clauses for controller-to-controller transfers. You can obtain a copy of our Standard Contractual Clauses by sending an email to</b> %{privacy_email}<b>. These are based on the official template provided by the EU Commission.</b>",item_three:'With AMAZON third party management assessment providers: Vantage Leadership Consulting, LLC ("<b>Vantage</b>"), Shaker Consulting Group, Inc. ("<b>Shaker</b>"), Aspiring Minds, Inc. ("<b>Aspiring Minds</b>"), Personnel Decisions Research Institutes, LLC ("<b>PDRI</b>"), and NCS Pearson, Inc. ("<b>Pearson</b>") that send the online assessments to Applicants and collect the corresponding assessment responses. AMAZON has concluded standard contractual clauses for controller to processor data transfers with each third party vendor based on the %{eu_template}.',item_two:'With AMAZON third party cloud service provider Performance Assessment Network, Inc. ("<b>PAN</b>") that hosts this application in the USA on behalf of AMAZON as a data processor. PAN is certified under the EU-U.S. Privacy Shield, as you may see %{psi_privacy_shield}.',line_one:"AMAZON may share Application Data:",title:"6. Disclosure and Transfer of Application Data"},item_three:{line_one:'AMAZON may process the following personal data about you (hereinafter jointly referred to as "<b>Application Data</b>"): identification data (name, email address and generated ID) as well as assessment results (numerical scores on each item). For generating the assessment results, we process personal data submitted by the Applicants.',line_two:"We do not process any gender or ethnicity data (or other special categories of personal data) nor do we process any open-ended text responses other than optional feedback (on the Assessment and the overall Assessment setup) submitted by an Applicant who took the Assessment.",title:"3. Processing of your Application Data"},item_two:{line_one:'The controller is the hiring AMAZON company; it determines how and why your personal data is processed ("<b>Data Controller</b>"). In the EU, our addresses can be found at "Questions and queries" under the following link: %{privacy_eu}. In the United States, please consult %{privacy_us}. In Japan, please consult %{privacy_jp}.',title:"2. Who is the Controller?"},privacy_notice:"Privacy Notice"},page_title:"AMAZON Candidate Online Assessment Privacy Notice"},candidate_dashboard:{alt_text:{profile_photo:"Profile photo"},notification:"Starting Tuesday, January 30th, 2018, users applying for US-based industry jobs may see additional questions for their applications. Please click <a href='%{wiki_link}' target='_blank'>here</a> to learn more.",profile_title:"Please make sure that the following information is up-to-date and accurate. Updates made to your profile will be reflected in any existing applications.",tabs:{applications:"Application",profile:"Profile",referrals:"Referrals"}},candidate_portal_errors:{business_constraint_violation:{button_text:"Working at Amazon",internal_user_button_text:"Follow up on TT",message:"We are sorry for the inconvenience. It looks like you have encountered an issue. Our technical team is looking into it. Please check back soon.",message_continued:"If you'd like to learn more about working at Amazon in the meantime, click the button below.",title:"Whoops, Something Went Wrong"}},cloud_drive_picker:{account:"Account",choose_file_caption:"Choose a file to upload",close_option:"Cancel",cloud_login_window_title:"oauth",drive_error_title:"Drive Error",drive_item_file:"File",drive_item_folder:"Folder",drive_name:"Files from %{driveName}",drive_provider_default_error_message:"An error occurred contacting the cloud drive",drop_box_name:"DropBox",error_modal:{dropbox:{email_verify:{body:"<p>To upload a resume from Dropbox you need to complete this step and try again.</p><p>If you would like to verify your email, we will redirect you to the Dropbox help center for instructions.</p>",link:"https://help.dropbox.com/accounts-billing/settings-sign-in/verify-email",primary_button_text:"Verify email in Dropbox",secondary_button_text:"Cancel",title:"Sorry, your Dropbox email address has not been verified."}}},file_properties_last_modified:"Last Modified",file_properties_name:"Name",file_properties_size:"Size",google_drive_name:"GoogleDrive",load_more_results:"Load More",one_drive_name:"OneDrive",one_drive_not_provisioned:"Your OneDrive does not currently have any files available to upload. Please add files to your OneDrive account and try again or select another option to upload your resume.",picked_file_item:"File selected for upload",root_folder_name:"My Files",search_cancel_hint:"Cancel search",search_placeholder:"Search for a file",search_usage_hint:"Enter a filename to search for",upload_option:"Upload File",upload_option_usage_hint:"To enable the upload option please select a file"},communication_preferences:{email_settings:{body:"Subscribing to emails from amazon.jobs keeps you informed about the latest job opportunities at Amazon and lets hiring teams know you're interested.",header:"Email settings",meta:"Please note: email notifications concerning any active job applications cannot be turned off",sub_header:"Receive emails from amazon.jobs",success_toast:{subscribed:"You've been successfully subscribed",unsubscribed:"You've been successfully unsubscribed"},title:"Communication Preferences"},error_toast:{message:"Something went wrong. Please try again."},sms_settings:{body1:"Enable amazon.jobs to send you SMS updates on your job applications. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply.",body2:"By enabling, you acknowledge that you agree to our <a target='_blank' href='%{termsAndConditionsLink}'>Terms of Service</a> and <a target='_blank' href='%{privacyPolicyLink}'>Privacy Notice</a>. You can withdraw consent at any time.",quiet_hours:{body:"Stop receiving SMS notifications during certain hours of the day.",end_time_label:"To",header:"Set quiet hours",start_time_label:"From",success_toast:{disabled:"Quiet hours disabled",enabled:"Quiet hours enabled",updated:"Quiet hours updated"},timezone_label:"Select time zone"},sub_header:"Enable SMS updates",success_toast:{subscribed:"You've been successfully subscribed",unsubscribed:"You've been successfully unsubscribed"}}},cookies:{banner:{acceptButton:"Accept All",customizeButton:"Customize cookies",text:"We use cookies and similar tools to provide and improve our site and your candidate experience and to display ads. Select \u201cAccept all\u201d to consent or \u201cCustomize cookies\u201d to manage your options and learn more.",title:"Select your cookie preferences"},eu_uk:{banner:{acceptButton:"Accept all",customizeButton:"Customize cookies",footerText:"For more information about how we use cookies and information we collect, please navigate to your country\u2019s cookie notice (if applicable) via our <a target='_blank' href='%{privacyDataUrl}'>Privacy Notice and Data Policy page</a>.",rejectButton:"Continue without accepting",text:"We use cookies and similar tools to provide and improve our site and your candidate experience. We also use operational cookies to make our site work. If you agree, we will set certain analytics cookies to help us improve our website as explained in our cookies notice, as well as set advertising cookies to display ads. Advertising cookies includes first and third-party cookies, which store or access standard device information such as a unique identifier. Third-parties use cookies to serve you with relevant advertisements and job recommendations based on your interactions with Amazon.Jobs and third-party sites. We will only set analytics or advertising cookies if you accept them. Select \u201cAccept all\u201d to consent or \u201cCustomize cookies\u201d to make more detailed choices and learn more.",title:"Notice of Right to Opt-Out of Sharing"}},us:{banner:{acceptButton:"Accept all",customizeButton:"Customize cookies",footerText:"For more information about how we use cookies and information of how we collect cookies, please visit our <a class='underline' target='_blank' href='%{candidateCookieNotice}'>Candidate Cookie Notice</a> and <a class='underline' target='_blank' href='%{candidatePrivacyNotice}'>Candidate Privacy Notice</a> and the <a class='underline' target='_blank' href='%{californiaSupplementNotice}'>California supplement notice</a>.",rejectButton:"Reject all",
text:"Amazon Jobs uses cookies and similar tools such as pixels (collectively, \u201ccookies\u201d) for advertising purposes. The cookies collect and share information about you with third-parties to serve you with relevant advertisements and job recommendations based on your interactions with Amazon Jobs and third-party sites.  California residents may exercise their right to opt-out of the sharing of information for advertising purposes by clicking toggling the buttons below. You can also manage your cookie preferences through the <a class='underline' target='_blank' href='%{cookiePreferenceCenter}'>Cookie Preference Center</a>.",title:"Notice of Right to Opt-Out of Sharing"}}},ctm_redirect:{cancel:"Return to Amazon.jobs",continue:"Continue to application",model_body:"This role requires applications to be completed in Your career.",model_header:"Leaving Amazon.jobs"},errors:{"401_show":{header:"401",sub_header:"Hm. We don't think you should be allowed to do this (but we could be wrong!)"},"403_show":{header:"403",sub_header:"Sorry, we've encountered a problem. We'll have the problem fixed as soon as possible, please try again at a later time."},"404_show":{get_answers:{button_text:"Get help",description:"Check out our FAQs to get answers to your questions.",title:"Get answers"},get_to_know_us:{button_text:"Learn more",description:"Learn more about working at Amazon, and see stories from our pioneers.",title:"Get to know us"},header:"404",search_jobs:{button_text:"Search jobs",description:"Find your perfect job by title, team, or location.",title:"Search jobs"},sub_header:"Hm. The page you're looking for seems to have disappeared (sorry about that!)."},"406_show":{header:"406",sub_header:"We can't respond to the request the way it was asked. Ask differently!"},"500_show":{header:"500",sub_header:"Aw man, something went wrong with our servers (sorry about that!)."},bad_country_code:"That country code doesn't exist in our database! Please check your URL for typos, or