h of the following supported languages you'd prefer to use instead.",page_title:"Please select a language",proceed_in_language:"Proceed in %{language}",sub_description:"Amazon.jobs will revert to %{language} as your default language once your forms have been submitted."}},page_titles:{adapt:"Adapt Plan",application_success:"Thank you for your application",applications:"Applications",blue_badge_profile_with_external_auth:"Connect to Amazon VPN or internet network to continue",candidate_referral:"Refer a Candidate",forms_complete:"Forms complete",generic_error:"Whoops, something went wrong",job_application:"Apply to a Job",maximum_active_dispositions_reached:"You have 4 open job applications",non_blue_badge_or_temporary_employee:"You must be a full time employee with blue badge in order to request an internal transfer",pip:"Pivot Plan",preferences:"Email preferences",profile:"Profile",referrals:"Referrals",summary:"Summary",vp_approval_required:"Eligibility for Country-to-Country Transfer Support"},preferences:{email:{body:"Email notifications from amazon.jobs communicate important information about your application status and are how we notify you about potential next steps in the recruiting process, as well as any future career opportunities that may be of interest to you-it's recommended that you always keep these notifications enabled.",saved:"Preferences saved!",sign_in:"sign in to amazon.jobs.",subscribe_email_title:"Subscribe to all email notifications?",subscribed:"subscribed",subscribed_text:". We'll notify you about application status updates, interview or assessment invites, other career opportunities at Amazon etc.",switch:{no_label:"NO",yes_label:"YES"},unsubscribed:"unsubscribed",unsubscribed_text:". You'll no longer be notified about application status updates, interview or assessment invites, other career opportunities at Amazon etc. You can opt back in at any time.",unsubscribed_unauthenticated_text:". You'll no longer be notified about application status updates, interview or assessment invites, other career opportunities at Amazon etc. Once you close this window, you won't be able to opt back in unless you %{sign_in}"}},referral:{already_exists_screen:{error:"A referral for this candidate to this job already exists",header:"%{candidate_name} has already applied to this position",message:'%{candidate_name} has already applied or been referred for %{job_title}. <span class="bold">If you were assisting this candidate with their application and you believe that the candidate intended for you to refer them to Amazon, %{submit_ticket} as soon as possible to ensure that the referral is registered correctly.</span> We appreciate your recommendation and would like you to keep referring talented individuals to Amazon.',ticket_text:"please submit a ticket here"},employee_exists_screen:{error:"Referral for amazon employees is not allowed",header:"%{candidate_name} is already an employee at Amazon",internal_transfer_page:"internal transfer",message:"We appreciate your recommendation, however the Employee Referral Program only supports external candidates. Current Amazon employees are responsible for submitting their own applications. If interested, please ask %{candidate_name} to submit an %{internal_transfer_link} application in JobFinder."},employee_referral_page_link_name:"visit the Employee Referral page",employee_referral_program_text:"Employee Referral Program",endorsement_help:"By clicking submit, you confirm that you\u2019ve received permission from the candidate to submit their resume and personal details to Amazon and you\u2019ve read the %{employee_referral_program} Participation information on the Inside Page.",fields:{endorsement:"Endorsement",endorsement_question:"Are you making an employee referral or submitting a networking lead?",endorsement_types:{eligibility:{general_recommendation:"Eligible for a bonus",unverified_submission:"Not eligible for a bonus"},general_recommendation:"I know this candidate personally or professionally and I am willing to endorse them.",placeholders:{endorsement:"Are you referring an Employee Referral or Networking Lead?"},titles:{general_recommendation:"Employee Referral",unverified_submission:"Networking Lead"},unverified_submission:"I do not know this candidate well, but I would like to submit them for consideration."}},form:{actions:{submit:"Submit referral"},errors:{endorsement_not_present:"Please select an option from the list",resume_blank:"Please upload the candidate's resume to continue."},headers:{address_information:"Address information",candidate_details:"Candidate details",candidate_resume:"Candidate resume"},resume:{upload_resume_title:"Click to upload candidate's resume"},toast:{submit_success:"Referral submitted!"}},internal_email_domain_screen:{amazon_job_page:"amazon.jobs",error:"Referral for Amazon employees is not allowed",header:"%{candidate_name} is already an employee at Amazon",message:"We appreciate your recommendation; however, the Employee Referral Program only supports external candidate referrals. Current Amazon and Amazon subsidiary employees (including contingent and temporary workers) are responsible for submitting their own applications. If interested, please ask %{candidate_name} to submit their application through %{amazon_job_link} to be considered for this role."},learn_more_message:"To learn more about next steps, please %{employee_referral_page}.",referral_limit:{footer_text:"Candidates remaining",tooltip_label:"More details about referral submission maximums",tooltip_text:"A total of 50 unique candidates can be referred each calendar year which refreshes on January 1. Both employee referrals and networking leads add to your referral maximum for the year. <a class='underline' target='_blank' href='%{referralLimitPolicy}'>View Referral policy</a> for additional info."},referral_limit_exceeded_screen:{application_profile:"Application Profile",glassdoor_message:"Help attract talent for Amazon. Glassdoor is one of the most popular sites for job seekers. Help us continue to attract top talent by %{glassdoor_link}.",glassdoor_page:"submitting a review of Amazon on Glassdoor",header:"You have 0 new candidates left to refer this year",learn_more_message:"To learn more about your local program policies, please %{employee_referral_page}.",message:'Thank you for your participation in the employee referral program. Each calendar year you can refer up to 50 unique candidates, which, will automatically refresh January 1st. <span class="bold">You have made 50 unique referrals for this calendar year, but you can still refer candidates you\u2019ve already referred this year to more roles.</span> You can also share the job directly so they can apply to the role themselves.',update_application_profile:"If the candidate has applied to Amazon before, please have them update their %{application_profile}, including an updated resume.",visit_employee_referral_page:"visit the Employee Referral Page"},screen:{header:"Provide the following details to submit your referral for the %{job_title} position"},showing_recent_500_referrals:"Showing your 500 most recent referrals.",success_screen:{application_profile:"Application Profile",back_to_job_finder:"Go to homepage",back_to_referral_dashboard:"Back to amazon.jobs",glassdoor_message:"Help attract talent for Amazon. Glassdoor is one of the most popular sites for job seekers. Help us continue to attract top talent by %{glassdoor_link}.",glassdoor_page:"submitting a review of Amazon on Glassdoor",header:"Thank you for your referral!",learn_more_message:"To learn more about your local program policies, please %{employee_referral_page}",success_message:"Thank you for referring %{candidate_name} for the %{job_title} position. We will review your referral candidate to determine if they are a good match for this role and reach out if we decide to move forward with next steps.",update_application_profile:"If the candidate has applied to Amazon before, please have them update their %{application_profile}, including an updated resume.",visit_employee_referral_page:"visit the Employee Referral Page."}},referral_tab:{loading_referrals:{header:"Please wait while we fetch your referrals..."},no_referrals:{call_to_action:"Search for a job to refer someone you know",header:"Sorry, we don't have any referrals from you on record"},recent_referrals:{disclaimer:"Please visit <a href='%{link}'>Inside Amazon</a> for payment eligibility regarding your referrals",disclaimer_nolink:"Please visit Inside Amazon for payment eligibility regarding your referrals",header:"Candidates you've referred",hiring_manager:"HM: ",inside_amazon_link:"https://inside.amazon.com/en/Employment/Hiring/referral/Pages/GlobalERPLandingPage.aspx",job_id:"Job ID: ",less_referrals:"Show %{num_referrals} fewer referral(s)",more_referrals:"Show %{num_referrals} more referral(s)",referred:"Referred"}},self_identification:{body:{content:"Your application process on amazon.jobs is specific to the type of role you\u2019ve applied for, so it\u2019s important to let us know which type of applicant you are. Please select one of the following",corporate_user:{content:"Select if you are an experienced professional, student, or recent graduate who applied for a corporate role at Amazon.",title:"I applied for a corporate role"},hvh_user:{content:"Click here if you applied for an hourly, part-time, or seasonal job in  fulfillment or customer service at Amazon.",title:"I applied for a role in fulfillment or customer service"},select_country:"We need to know where the job you applied for is located.",university_user:{content:"Click here if you're a university student or recent graduate who applied for an internship or a new graduate role at Amazon.",title:"I applied for an internship or new graduate role"}},cancel_message:"Cancel",create_account_link:"Create one!",loading_message:"Please wait while we fetch some things",regions:{BRA:"Brazil",CAN:"Canada",CHN:"China",CRI:"Costa Rica",DEU:"Germany",ESP:"Spain",FRA:"France",GBR:"United Kingdom",IND:"India",IRL:"Ireland",ISR:"Israel",ITA:"Italy",JPN:"Japan",LUX:"Luxembourg",ROU:"Romania",USA:"United States",default:"Please Select A Country/Region",others:"All other countries"},title:{email_lookup:"Your amazon.jobs account",login:"Log in with your amazon.jobs account to continue",select_category:"Let us know the type of role you applied for",select_country:"In which country/region did you apply to work?"},view_application:"View Application"},shared:{accessibility:{button:{remove:"remove"},keyboard:{instructions:"Please press enter to select, press arrow keys to change the current row's rank up or down",itemLifted:"You have lifted item at position %{position}",itemPlace:"You have dropped the item. It has moved from position %{previousPosition} to %{currentPosition}.",movedDown:"You have moved the lifted item down to position %{position}.",movedUp:"You have moved the lifted item up to position %{position}."}},account_dropdown:{account:{communication_settings:"Settings",email_settings:"Email settings",setting:"Account security",sign_out:"Sign out"},applications:"Applications",profile:"Profile",settings:"Settings",title:"Preferences"},ai_preference_modal:{actions:{confirm_button:"Confirm",i_agree:"I agree",i_do_not_agree:"I do not agree",learn_more:"Learn more"},job_search:{ai_preference_validation_error:"Please select an answer",description:"Amazon may leverage AI models to use your information such as browsing history, resumes, Amazon.jobs profiles, and skills assessment results in the following ways:",question_1:"To recommend job openings that match your skills and interests*",question_2:"To recommend you to recruiters for relevant jobs you haven't applied to*",question_3:"To improve our job search tools to create a more personalized and seamless experience*",title:"Use of AI in your job search"},modal_title:"Find your perfect role faster with our intelligent job search tools",use_of_ai:{description:"Making your job search smarter and more personalized, Amazon uses artificial intelligence to help you find the right opportunities faster. To better connect you with positions that match your career goals, we'll personalize recommendations based on your resume details, Amazon.jobs profile, skills assessment results, and the types of roles you've shown interest in. This tailored approach helps ensure you discover positions that best align with your unique skills and experience.",title:"Use of AI in Hiring"}},ai_preference_modal_v2:{shared:{continue_button:"Continue",disclaimer:"Providing consent to use your information is completely voluntary. Your decision to agree or not agree won't affect how your application is evaluated.",learn_more:"Learn more",submitting:"Submitting..."},step_1:{description:"You can choose to receive personalized job recommendations, be recommended to recruiters for other jobs that may be a good fit, and help enhance Amazon job-search tools.",description_extended:"Amazon uses AI to enhance your job search and interview experience.",no_description:"Continue without personalized job recommendations, recommendations to recruiters, or using my info to improve tools.",no_description_extended:"Continue without personalized job recommendations, recommending me to recruiters, using my info to improve tools, or transcribing my interviews for better interviewer engagement.",no_title:"No",title:"Would you like to improve your job-search experience?",title_extended:"Before you continue, do we have permission to improve your job search and interview experience?",validation_error:"Please select an option to continue.",yes_description:"Provide personalized job recommendations, recommend me to recruiters, and use my info to improve tools.",yes_description_extended:"Provide personalized job recommendations, recommend me to recruiters, use my info to improve job-search tools, and transcribe my interviews for better interviewer engagement.",yes_title:"Yes"},step_2:{change_description:"I want to use these features.",change_title:"No, I've changed my mind",confirm_description:"I don't want to use these features.",confirm_title:"Yes, I'm sure",description:"If you don't agree:",title:"Are you sure? You'll miss out on features that can help you find the right role faster.",title_extended:"Are you sure? You'll miss out on features that can help throughout your job search and interview experience.",warning_1:"You won't see recommended jobs based on your skills or experience.",warning_2:"You won't be recommended to recruiters for relevant roles.",warning_3:"Your information won't help improve our job-search tools.",warning_3_extended:"Your interviewer will take notes during your interview, which may impact their engagement."}},application:{back_to_job_finder:"Go to homepage",back_to_jobs_website:"Back to amazon.jobs",back_to_jobs_website_label:"Not what you're looking for?",view_dashboard:"View my applications"},application_complete:{about_amazon:"About Amazon",about_amazon_description:"Learn more about Amazon's culture and what makes us peculiar",application_complete:"Next steps of your application",assessment:"assessment",assessment_required:"As part of your application, you\u2019re required to complete an online assessment. We won\u2019t be able to consider your application until you\u2019ve completed this important step.",assessment_status:{disable_popup_blocker:"Please ensure that Popup Blocker is disabled, as the assessment will open in a new window.",loading:"Loading assessment...",timeout:"We're sorry. This assessment is temporarily unavailable. Please wait 5 minutes before refreshing the page to try again. ",wait:"Just a few more seconds! We are getting your assessment ready. This can sometime take up to one minute. If you prefer to complete this step at a later time, it is safe to close your browser. You can access your assessment from your application dashboard by clicking <a href='%{dashboardLink}' target='_blank' rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">here</a>. While you wait, you can also learn more about Amazon by clicking on any of the links under the <b>Learn more</b> section."},assessment_third_party:"Please note: This assessment is managed by a third-party assessments provider and will open in a new window. ",begin_assessment:"Start assessment",check_back_regularly:"Any updates to your application status will be reflected on your Application dashboard, so be sure to check back regularly.",expires:"Expires: %{assessment_expiry_date}",follow_our_day_one_blog:"Day One blog",follow_our_day_one_blog_description:"Get the latest Amazon new and stories by following our blog",forms_complete:"Forms complete",forms_saved:'The information you have provided has been saved. Our Recruitment Team will be in touch to update you on next steps. In the meantime  feel free to find out more about working at Amazon using the links provided under "Learn More".',go_to_application_dashboard:"Go to Application dashboard",internal_assessment_clarification:'<b>Amazon employees:</b> If you\'re facing login issues, use the same <a href="https://atoz.amazon.work" target=\'_blank\' rel="noopener noreferrer">A2Z</a> account from a personal device \u2014 on guest network or non-Amazon Wi-Fi/network.',interviewing_at_amazon:"Interviewing at Amazon",interviewing_at_amazon_description:"Learn more about Amazon's interview process and how we get to know you better",learn_more:"Learn more",next_steps:"Next steps...",next_steps_assessment:"Complete online assessment (required)",receive_sms_updates:{body:{1:"To enable SMS updates, please verify the mobile number you provided so we know you own that number and we're sending the updates to the right person."},body1:"To enable SMS updates, please verify the mobile number you provided so we know you own that number and we're sending the updates to the right person.",header:"Get SMS updates on your job applications"},survey_html:"Interested in helping us improve 